# POLLY, HOME in each state: the progression as bars (the same view recording or listening), the big chord over them.
# FREE stopped and playing (the chord alone, a line under it); LOOP stopped (bar 1 ringed teal: PLAY starts there) and
# playing (the bar playing teal, its beats, "next"); a 12-bar progression scrolled to the bar playing; LOOP under an
# Intro; SONG stopped, in its Intro, its sections' passes, a fill coming, the Ending ("next: ..." under the chord);
# a new progression's take; step writing. Keys: F3 0, A3 4, C4 7, E4 11, G4 14. 120 BPM: a bar is 2000 ms.
wait 300
spin K2 15
expect tempo 120
expect mode 0
wait 50
shot free_stopped.png
# ---- FREE, playing: a chord from the keys, big
tap PLAY
wait 300
key 7 down
key 11 down
key 14 down
wait 100
key 7 up
key 11 up
key 14 up
wait 600
expect chord_root 0
shot free_playing.png
tap PLAY
wait 200
# ---- LOOP, stopped: P1's bars, bar 1 ringed (where PLAY starts)
press HOME
tapkey w0
release HOME
expect mode 1
expect app_loop 1
wait 50
shot loop_stopped.png
# playing: bar 2 teal, its beats along its foot; next chord by the big one
tap PLAY
wait 2700
expect loop_now 1
shot loop_playing.png
# ---- a 12-bar progression (P5 Blues) from the next bar line: two rows, scrolled to the bar playing
press HOME
tapkey w4
release HOME
wait 2000
expect loop_now 5
wait 16500
shot loop12_playing.png
tap PLAY
wait 200
wait 50
shot loop12_stopped.png
# ---- LOOP under an Intro: the bars wait, bar 1 ringed; "starts after the Intro"
press HOME
tapkey w0
tapkey b0
release HOME
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect sect 1
shot loop_intro.png
tap PLAY
wait 200
# ---- SONG: P1 x2 (Groove A), P3 (Groove B), P8 (Groove A); Intro and Ending on
tap HOME
expect page 1
tapkey w0
tapkey w2
tapkey w7
expect rows 3
spin K1 -9
expect cursor 1
spin K4 1
expect row_rep1 2
spin K1 1
spin K3 3
expect row_sect2 2
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect mode 2
tap PLAY
wait 200
tap HOME
expect page 0
wait 50
shot song_stopped.png
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect sect 1
shot song_intro.png
# section 1, its first pass (of 2): next, P1 again
wait 5700
expect sect 2
expect row 1
shot song_row1.png
# its second pass: a fill in its last bar, then P3 in Groove B
wait 9000
expect row 1
shot song_row1_pass2.png
wait 4000
shot song_fill.png
wait 4000
expect row 2
expect sect 3
shot song_row2.png
wait 13000
expect row 3
shot song_row3.png
wait 9000
expect sect 6
shot song_ending.png
wait 6000
expect playing 0
expect page 0
# ---- a new progression's take (REC in FREE): the REC line, the bars growing; waiting for PLAY first, then a bar of
# count-in (its beats left big in bar 1)
wait 100
turn K4 -20
wait 100
expect mode 0
tap REC
expect take 1
wait 50
shot rec_wait.png
tap PLAY
wait 1000
expect take 1
expect count_in 2
shot rec_count_in.png
wait 1000
wait 2300
expect take 2
key 4 down
key 7 down
key 11 down
wait 100
key 4 up
key 7 up
key 11 up
wait 2000
key 0 down
key 4 down
key 7 down
wait 100
key 0 up
key 4 up
key 7 up
wait 1500
shot rec_take.png
tap REC
expect take 0
tap PLAY
wait 300
# ---- step writing (REC on HOME stopped, LOOP): the cursor's bar ringed coral
press HOME
tapkey w11
release HOME
expect app_loop 12
tap REC
expect rec_chords 1
key 7 down
key 11 down
key 14 down
wait 50
key 7 up
key 11 up
key 14 up
wait 50
key 4 down
key 7 down
key 11 down
wait 50
key 4 up
key 7 up
key 11 up
wait 650
expect cbeat 8
shot rec_step.png
tap REC
expect rec_chords 0
